+### Bugs fixed on the way
+
+- `gz2xz.py` called `get_files()` without importing it — a `NameError` on every run.
+- `gz2xz.py` and `xz2gz.py` both `stat()`ed the source *after* `unlink()`ing it, so "original size",
+  the ratio and the whole "total space saved" summary were always 0. `convert_gz_xz.py` measures first.
+- `newest_files.py` printed *"Top N oldest files"* over a newest-first sort, and `oldest_files.py`
+  printed *"Top N fresh files"* over an oldest-first sort — the labels were swapped between the two
+  files. `files_by_time.py` derives its header from `--order`.
